# The card library ships inside the package (setup.py stages it at alloy/_data/library).
graft library
# The docs and examples the package's docstrings and errors point at, and the agent quick start (2026-11-11).
# docs/: the public set only (an allow-list: setup.py's DOCS_PUBLIC; AGENTS.md also ships in the wheel).
# install.sh does not ship (pip only).
graft docs/public
graft docs/known_gaps
graft docs/guide
graft examples
include AGENTS.md llms.txt
global-exclude __pycache__ *.pyc .DS_Store
